      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Child class of HashSet .\n\n2. Stores unique data .\n\n3. It stores data in two datastructure that is LinkedList and Hash table\n\n4. In Linked List it stores data in insertion order , thus when traversed return data in insertion order .\n\n5. Hash table: Helps with efficient operations such as add(), contains(), and remove().\n\n  Doubly linked list: Maintains the insertion order for traversal.\n\n",
